---
import MainLayout from '../layouts/MainLayout.astro';
import InquiryForm from '../components/InquiryForm.astro';
import IconBadge from '../components/IconBadge.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
---
<MainLayout title={site.shortName}>
  <section class="home-hero">
    <img src="/images/hero-community.jpg" alt="A welcoming shared living space with comfortable seating and natural light" width="1800" height="1050" />
    <div class="overlay"></div>
    <div class="container hero-content">
      <p class="eyebrow">Recovery housing in Pittsburgh</p>
      <h1>A stable place to build what comes next.</h1>
      <p class="lead">Structured recovery residences for men and women, grounded in peer support, accountability, and connection to care.</p>
      <div class="actions"><a class="button" href="/contact/#inquiry">Ask about housing</a><a class="button button--light" href={site.phoneHref}>Call {site.phone}</a></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="trust" aria-label="Organization credentials"><div class="container trust-inner"><span><IconBadge name="heart-handshake" small />501(c)(3) nonprofit</span><span><IconBadge name="badge-check" small />DDAP-licensed residences</span><span><IconBadge name="shield-check" small />WestPARR inspected</span><span><IconBadge name="users-round" small />AA/NA-based recovery</span></div></section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container grid-2 intro">
      <div><p class="eyebrow">A foundation for recovery</p><h2>Housing built around structure, dignity, and community.</h2></div>
      <div><p class="lead">Recovery takes more than a roof. New Beginnings offers substance-free homes where residents can strengthen daily routines, connect with peers, and keep moving toward greater stability.</p><p>Our residences serve adults across several Pittsburgh-area communities. Exact locations are shared privately during the intake process.</p><a class="text-link" href="/recovery-housing/">Learn how recovery housing works</a></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--tint">
    <div class="container"><div class="section-head"><p class="eyebrow">Find your path</p><h2>Start where you are.</h2></div>
      <div class="grid-3 paths">
        <article class="card"><IconBadge name="house" /><span>01</span><h3>I need housing</h3><p>Learn about our recovery residences, the intake process, and how to begin.</p><a class="text-link" href="/admissions/">Admissions information</a></article>
        <article class="card"><IconBadge name="user-round-check" /><span>02</span><h3>I am helping someone</h3><p>Find clear information for families, providers, case managers, and referral partners.</p><a class="text-link" href="/referrals/">Make a referral</a></article>
        <article class="card"><IconBadge name="hand-heart" /><span>03</span><h3>I want to support the work</h3><p>Help create stable, recovery-focused housing in Pittsburgh communities.</p><a class="text-link" href="/support-us/">Support New Beginnings</a></article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section housing-split"><div class="container grid-2">
    <img src="/images/community-table.jpg" alt="A shared table prepared for a group conversation" width="900" height="750" loading="lazy" />
    <div class="housing-copy"><p class="eyebrow">Men’s and women’s housing</p><h2>Recovery residences across the Pittsburgh area.</h2><p class="lead">Our network includes homes for adult men and women in established neighborhoods, including Sheraden, Brighton Heights, and McKees Rocks.</p><ul class="rule-list"><li><strong>Men’s recovery housing</strong><a href="/mens-housing/">Learn about men’s residences</a></li><li><strong>Women’s recovery housing</strong><a href="/womens-housing/">Learn about women’s residences</a></li></ul></div>
  </div></section>

  <section class="section section--navy"><div class="container grid-2"><div><p class="eyebrow">Accountability you can verify</p><h2>Standards matter when choosing recovery housing.</h2></div><div><p class="lead">New Beginnings is a nonprofit provider with residences licensed by the Pennsylvania Department of Drug and Alcohol Programs and an inspected listing with WestPARR.</p><a class="button button--light" href="/transparency/">View credentials and public records</a></div></div></section>
  <InquiryForm />
</MainLayout>
<style>
  .home-hero { position: relative; display: grid; min-height: min(48rem, calc(100svh - 7.25rem)); align-items: end; overflow: hidden; }
  .home-hero > img, .overlay { position: absolute; inset: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; }
  .overlay { background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(18,48,61,.86) 0%, rgba(18,48,61,.65) 52%, rgba(18,48,61,.12) 100%); }
  .hero-content { position: relative; display: grid; gap: 1.5rem; padding-block: clamp(5rem, 10vw, 9rem); color: var(--white); }
  .hero-content h1 { max-width: 13ch; color: var(--white); }
  .hero-content .lead { max-width: 42rem; }
  .hero-content .eyebrow { color: #9ed7d2; }
  .trust { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--slate-200); background: var(--paper); }
  .trust-inner { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); }
  .trust span { display: flex; padding: 1.15rem 1rem; border-left: 1px solid var(--slate-200); align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: .7rem; font-size: .92rem; font-weight: 700; text-align: left; }
  .trust span:last-child { border-right: 1px solid var(--slate-200); }
  .intro h2 { max-width: 15ch; margin-top: 1rem; }
  .intro > div:last-child { display: grid; gap: 1.25rem; }
  .paths article span { color: var(--blue-600); font-size: .8rem; font-weight: 750; letter-spacing: .12em; }
  .housing-split img { width: 100%; height: 38rem; object-fit: cover; }
  .housing-copy { display: grid; gap: 1.25rem; }
  .section--navy .eyebrow { color: #9ed7d2; }
  .section--navy .button { margin-top: 1.5rem; }
  @media (max-width: 760px) { .trust-inner { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; } .housing-split img { height: 24rem; } }
</style>
